# Data & artifacts (track these with DVC/git-lfs or keep out of git)
# The experimental record is version-controlled. It is ~220KB compressed against a
# ~1.7MB repo, and it cannot be regenerated: these are sampled model outputs, so a
# rerun produces different responses and costs real money. Small price for durability.
!data/raw/
!data/coded/
!data/human/
data/*.tmp
outputs/
results/
runs/
checkpoints/
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.safetensors
wandb/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.out
*.synctex.gz
paper/*.pdf
*.log
